<title>USA: Ovits considering leaving Disney - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Ovits considering leaving Disney - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hollywood power player Michael Ovitz has talked with Sony in recent weeks about taking a top job with the electronics giant, after a year serving in the No. 2 position at Disney, according to a story in Thursday's Wall Street Journal.</p>
<p>The story quoted a Sony spokesman saying the company had no plan to hire Ovitz.</p>
<p>Should Ovitz move to Sony, he would likely head Sony Corp of America, the story said.</p>
<p>Ovitz was unavailable for comment, the story said.</p>
</text>
